# Oath of Jace: "When Oath of Jace enters, draw three cards, then discard two cards. At the beginning of your upkeep,
# scry X, where X is the number of planeswalkers you control." Bot1 casts Chance-Met Elves and the Oath on turn 1: the
# Oath draws Counterspell, Lightning Bolt and Island and discards two of them (Counterspell and Lightning Bolt). In
# Bot1's turn 3 upkeep Bot1 controls no planeswalker: X is 0 and scry 0 is no scry (CR 701.22b; the ruling: "you won't
# scry at all. Abilities that trigger whenever you scry won't trigger"), so nothing is looked at (`! Bot1.Arrange`) and
# the Elves get no counter. Bot1 then casts Karn, Scion of Urza. In the turn 5 upkeep X is 1: Bot1 scries 1, and the
# Elves trigger and get their counter.

